    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1256">

                <pb facs="1227" n="941" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg941"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.142/1376</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-02-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 18, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: There is herewith transmitted to you
                    copies of two letters to the Department from the American Red Cross, dated
                    respectively <pb facs="1228" n="942" xml:id="pg942"/> February 12 and February
                        16,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1256-f1"/> relative to the obtaining of permits
                    from the British Government for the shipment of certain relief supplies (named
                    in the lists which are also herewith transmitted to you) destined for the Red
                    Cross Societies of Germany and Austria, and for the American Ambassador at
                    Constantinople for relief purposes in Turkey.</p>
                <p>You are instructed to secure the requested permits as promptly as possible, and
                    cable reply.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State: <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank L. Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1256-a1.xml" xpointer="d1256-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
